cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the datasets
  it evaluates. Research use only; not for clinical decision-making.
type: software
title: "ECG Trust Lab: trustworthy 12-lead ECG classification on PTB-XL"
abstract: >-
  Multi-label classification of the five PTB-XL diagnostic superclasses with
  a sealed fold-10 evaluation, calibration, selective abstention, subgroup,
  robustness, and explanation audits, an external SPH transport stress test,
  and a fail-closed Trust Sentinel research line.
authors:
  - name: "PTB-XL ECG Research Project"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ahmad986Ferdaws/ecg-trust-lab"
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - electrocardiogram
  - PTB-XL
  - calibration
  - selective classification
  - uncertainty
  - conformal prediction
